        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔞So, me and guys got together and made our very first horror game! We tried as hard as we could, but the result... Well, there were goosebumps! Whether from fear or from shame, we still don’t know =)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗿 So, the game is about a professional urbex who went where he shouldn’t have!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪓 In the best tradition of first-person puzzle horror, you will wander in the dark, find keys to locked doors, and escape from attacking mannequins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/b6de35a1d94750e053f9d868b0d9f96f.poster.avif?t=1756918831\" width=914 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/b6de35a1d94750e053f9d868b0d9f96f.webm?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📋 Search for mysterious notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 There’s some kind of meaning and keys for doors everywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/0b6a661f0690ebc91cffb0f8d5b37e9c.poster.avif?t=1756918831\" width=914 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/0b6a661f0690ebc91cffb0f8d5b37e9c.webm?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/0b6a661f0690ebc91cffb0f8d5b37e9c.mp4?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧻 Explore the atmospheric abandoned factory<br>🚨 Avoid deadly mannequins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 Beware of the darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/3778face7566f02350ba89c4084f7556.poster.avif?t=1756918831\" width=914 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/3778face7566f02350ba89c4084f7556.webm?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 We made the gameplay full of events and dynamic! Without dragging the game out with empty 8+ hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪓 Will you uncover the factory’s secret? Is it possible to survive there?! Let’s go, let’s figure it out!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔞So, me and guys got together and made our very first horror game! We tried as hard as we could, but the result... Well, there were goosebumps! Whether from fear or from shame, we still don’t know =)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗿 So, the game is about a professional urbex who went where he shouldn’t have!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪓 In the best tradition of first-person puzzle horror, you will wander in the dark, find keys to locked doors, and escape from attacking mannequins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/b6de35a1d94750e053f9d868b0d9f96f.poster.avif?t=1756918831\" width=914 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/b6de35a1d94750e053f9d868b0d9f96f.webm?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📋 Search for mysterious notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 There’s some kind of meaning and keys for doors everywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/0b6a661f0690ebc91cffb0f8d5b37e9c.poster.avif?t=1756918831\" width=914 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/0b6a661f0690ebc91cffb0f8d5b37e9c.webm?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/0b6a661f0690ebc91cffb0f8d5b37e9c.mp4?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧻 Explore the atmospheric abandoned factory<br>🚨 Avoid deadly mannequins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 Beware of the darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/3778face7566f02350ba89c4084f7556.poster.avif?t=1756918831\" width=914 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/3778face7566f02350ba89c4084f7556.webm?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 We made the gameplay full of events and dynamic! Without dragging the game out with empty 8+ hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪓 Will you uncover the factory’s secret? Is it possible to survive there?! Let’s go, let’s figure it out!</p>",
        "short_description": "You are an experienced urbex, who has set sights on another abandoned factory. But, having prepared for the hunt for adventures, you could not even think that they would be hunting you! What happened here?! The mystery will only be revealed by the light of the flashlight...",
